1489	       crossfades the active row's text to opacity 1 / the rest to
1490	       MOBILE_INACTIVE_OPACITY over 0.35s (measured contrast fix, see the
1491	       constant's own comment). R5 bugfix (kept): scaleShowcaseFrame() was
1492	       only ever called from setupDesktopEngine() (the isDesktop branch) -
1493	       on mobile the iframe kept its native 1440x900 box with no scale
1494	       transform at all, so the sticky cell showed an unscaled, cropped
