1610	      if (!opts.immediate){
1611	        /* "en kort lyftning" - the card lifts slightly mid-turn, an echo of
1612	           the hero card's own scale-up at the midpoint of its flip. R6 §7:
1613	           desktop only - on a narrow mobile stack the card's own row is
1614	           shallower, and even a small upward lift measurably narrowed the
1615	           gap to the heading above during the sweep test. Rotation alone
1616	           already reads as a flip; the lift is a nice-to-have, not load
1617	           bearing, so it is simplest to drop where the margin is tight. */
